{"unit_id":"MrWeiCodes__dsh-permgate#card-zh","repo":"MrWeiCodes/dsh-permgate","commit":"2f07cf69d5833d9365be14f0ed3290c3e290db9b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-permgate 是面向 DSH Web 的权限网关插件：它把工具调用接入宿主预执行审查，并在浏览器设置页提供分类配置与审批。用户可以为命令、区外读写、文件读写、图片读取、撤销、子代理和重复调用设置动作，也可维护项目规则与例外。自动审批可调用 DSH 模型服务，异常时按配置询问、允许或拒绝；需要人工处理时，弹窗展示调用信息并支持拒绝理由。配置保存在 DSH home。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:10221","index.js:8765","client.js:4615"]}
{"unit_id":"MrWeiCodes__dsh-permgate#card-en","repo":"MrWeiCodes/dsh-permgate","commit":"2f07cf69d5833d9365be14f0ed3290c3e290db9b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-permgate reviews DSH Web tool calls before execution. Its browser panel configures category actions, project rules, and exceptions. Optional model review uses a configured fallback; approval dialogs show call details and accept rejection reasons. Settings persist under DSH home.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:10221","index.js:8765","client.js:4615"]}
